{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "v01_gran_a",
   "role": "gran",
   "text": "就剩这么些了……",
   "file": "audio/vo/v01_gran_a.wav",
   "audioFrom": 139,
   "speechFrom": 143,
   "speechTo": 184
  },
  {
   "id": "v01_gran_b",
   "role": "gran",
   "text": "你可得对它好点儿啊。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v01_gran_b.wav",
   "audioFrom": 190,
   "speechFrom": 195,
   "speechTo": 244
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_01_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "名字。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_01_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 338,
   "speechFrom": 342,
   "speechTo": 351
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_02_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "……没有。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_02_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 353,
   "speechFrom": 363,
   "speechTo": 372
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_03_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "没有？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_03_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 373,
   "speechFrom": 377,
   "speechTo": 383
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_04_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "老太太管我叫黄毛。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_04_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 382,
   "speechFrom": 385,
   "speechTo": 413
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_05_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "不是那种黄毛啊！我可老实了。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_05_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 423,
   "speechFrom": 427,
   "speechTo": 472
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_06_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "多大？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_06_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 476,
   "speechFrom": 479,
   "speechTo": 488
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_07_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "今年秋天刚生的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_07_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 487,
   "speechFrom": 490,
   "speechTo": 516
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_08_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "这上头写着，你在她家住了四十多年。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_08_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 522,
   "speechFrom": 525,
   "speechTo": 582
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_09_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "那是我爸，我爷，我太爷……我们一家子都住那儿，一辈接一辈的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_09_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 583,
   "speechFrom": 584,
   "speechTo": 694
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_10_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "哎哎哎，拿走拿走！",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_10_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 702,
   "speechFrom": 706,
   "speechTo": 731
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_11_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "一杯水，你怕什么。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_11_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 731,
   "speechFrom": 735,
   "speechTo": 765
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_12_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "我沾水就得开口！开了口就收不回去了！",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_12_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 762,
   "speechFrom": 767,
   "speechTo": 827
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_13_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "……家里还有什么亲戚？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_13_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 834,
   "speechFrom": 838,
   "speechTo": 871
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_14_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "有个远房的。路边上、墙根底下，到处都是，你肯定见过。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_14_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 871,
   "speechFrom": 874,
   "speechTo": 987
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_15_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "叫什么？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_15_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 989,
   "speechFrom": 992,
   "speechTo": 1001
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_16_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "不告诉你。说出来丢人。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_16_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1001,
   "speechFrom": 1003,
   "speechTo": 1037
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_17_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "(sighs)有什么特长？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_17_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1041,
   "speechFrom": 1045,
   "speechTo": 1078
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_18_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "耐旱，不挑地，石头缝里都能活。还有……熬粥特别香。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_18_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1077,
   "speechFrom": 1083,
   "speechTo": 1160
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_19_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "知道为什么带你来吗？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_19_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1188,
   "speechFrom": 1192,
   "speechTo": 1212
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_20_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "不知道……我又不值钱。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_20_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1215,
   "speechFrom": 1218,
   "speechTo": 1260
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_21_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "最后一个问题。你到底多大了？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_21_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1267,
   "speechFrom": 1271,
   "speechTo": 1312
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_22_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "你是问我，还是问我们？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_22_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1313,
   "speechFrom": 1317,
   "speechTo": 1345
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_23_int",
   "role": "int",
   "text": "你们。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_23_int.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1350,
   "speechFrom": 1353,
   "speechTo": 1363
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_24_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "……一万年吧。差不多。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_24_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1373,
   "speechFrom": 1376,
   "speechTo": 1447,
   "xfadeWith": "v02_24_old"
  },
  {
   "id": "v02_24_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "……一万年吧。差不多。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v02_24_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1368,
   "speechFrom": 1376,
   "speechTo": 1447
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_1",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "那会儿我还是根野草，一熟就往地上掉。有人专掐那些熟了还不掉的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_1.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1520,
   "speechFrom": 1525,
   "speechTo": 1649
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_2",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "后来就住进罐子里了。这习惯，我们家留到了今天。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_2.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1653,
   "speechFrom": 1658,
   "speechTo": 1754
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_3",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "他们在骨头上刻我。刻得还挺像，熟透的谷子，都低着头。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_3.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1759,
   "speechFrom": 1762,
   "speechTo": 1871
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_4",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "有人写诗，说我是老天爷赏的。我也没好意思吭声。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_4.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1875,
   "speechFrom": 1880,
   "speechTo": 1980
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_5",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "贾思勰把怎么挑我写下来了：挑好穗子，割下来，挂高。后来的人照着做了一千多年。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_5.wav",
   "audioFrom": 1986,
   "speechFrom": 1989,
   "speechTo": 2169
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_6",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "这句你们都会背吧？背的时候，想过那一粒是打哪来的吗？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_6.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2173,
   "speechFrom": 2178,
   "speechTo": 2293
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_7",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "老宋写书，粮食放第一篇，珠宝放最后一篇。这人，我喜欢。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_7.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2298,
   "speechFrom": 2302,
   "speechTo": 2424
  },
  {
   "id": "v03_8",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "小米加步枪。那几年……我是真扛过事儿的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v03_8.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2428,
   "speechFrom": 2432,
   "speechTo": 2521
  },
  {
   "id": "v04_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "……谁让你们查的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v04_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2676,
   "speechFrom": 2680,
   "speechTo": 2704
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_01_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "那你到底……带我来干啥？",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_01_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2912,
   "speechFrom": 2915,
   "speechTo": 2953
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_02_man",
   "role": "man",
   "text": "(sighs)那老太太八十三了。儿子们早不种这个了。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_02_man.wav",
   "audioFrom": 2964,
   "speechFrom": 2968,
   "speechTo": 3083
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_03_man",
   "role": "man",
   "text": "哪天她不在了，坛子一收拾，你们就全没了。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_03_man.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3087,
   "speechFrom": 3095,
   "speechTo": 3203
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_04_man",
   "role": "man",
   "text": "抓你干啥。接你来的。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_04_man.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3208,
   "speechFrom": 3216,
   "speechTo": 3252
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_05_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "后来隔壁袋子跟我说，这老头干这个快四十年了。黑龙江到海南，一家一家敲门，就为讨一把种子。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_05_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3264,
   "speechFrom": 3267,
   "speechTo": 3444
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_06_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "房梁换成了铁架子，肉眼换成了测序仪。弯腰那一下，一直没变。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_06_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3448,
   "speechFrom": 3454,
   "speechTo": 3574
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_07_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "都说好种子是老天爷赏的。我活了一万年，老天爷一回没见着。见着的，全是这样的人。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_07_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3581,
   "speechFrom": 3586,
   "speechTo": 3745
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_08_old",
   "role": "old",
   "text": "……行吧。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_08_old.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3790,
   "speechFrom": 3793,
   "speechTo": 3807
  },
  {
   "id": "v05_09_kid",
   "role": "kid",
   "text": "我招。",
   "file": "audio/vo/v05_09_kid.wav",
   "audioFrom": 3818,
   "speechFrom": 3822,
   "speechTo": 3830
  }
 ],
